{"speciesId":602,"names":{"fr":"Anchwatt","es":"Tynamo","en":"Tynamo","ja":"シビシラス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Tout seuls, ils ne dégagent pas beaucoup d’électricité, mais un banc d’Anchwatt produit la même puissance qu’un éclair."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"While one alone doesn’t have much power, a chain of many Tynamo can be as powerful as lightning."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ils agissent en groupes. Ils possèdent un organe produisant de l’électricité et lancent des décharges en cas de danger."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"These Pokémon move in schools. They have an electricity-generating organ, so they discharge electricity if in danger."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"One alone can emit only a trickle of electricity, so a group of them gathers to unleash a powerful electric shock."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"One alone can emit only a trickle of electricity, so a group of them gathers to unleash a powerful electric shock."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Tout seuls, ils ne dégagent pas beaucoup d’électricité, mais un banc d’Anchwatt produit la même puissance qu’un éclair."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"La electricidad de uno solo es diminuta, pero, si multitud de Tynamo se conectan, consiguen la potencia de un rayo."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"While one alone doesn’t have much power, a chain of many Tynamo can be as powerful as lightning."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"１匹の 電力は 小さいが たくさんの シビシラスが つながると 雷と 同じ 威力になる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Tout seul, il ne dégage pas beaucoup d’électricité. Mais un banc d’Anchwatt produit des décharges surpuissantes."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Apenas puede generar energía por sí mismo, pero un banco de Tynamo puede crear violentas descargas eléctricas."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"One alone can emit only a trickle of electricity, so a group of them gathers to unleash a powerful electric shock."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"弱い 電気しか だせないので たくさんの シビシラスで 集まり 強力な 電気を 放つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Tout seuls, ils ne dégagent pas beaucoup d’électricité, mais un banc d’Anchwatt produit la même puissance qu’un éclair."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"La electricidad de uno solo es diminuta, pero, si multitud de Tynamo se conectan, consiguen la potencia de un rayo."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"While one alone doesn’t have much power, a chain of many Tynamo can be as powerful as lightning."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"１匹の 電力は 小さいが たくさんの シビシラスが つながると 雷と 同じ 威力になる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Tout seul, il ne dégage pas beaucoup d’électricité. Mais un banc d’Anchwatt produit des décharges surpuissantes."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Apenas puede generar energía por sí mismo, pero un banco de Tynamo puede crear violentas descargas eléctricas."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"One alone can emit only a trickle of electricity, so a group of them gathers to unleash a powerful electric shock."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"弱い 電気しか だせないので たくさんの シビシラスで 集まり 強力な 電気を 放つ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":602,"moves":[{"name":"tackle","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"thunder-wave","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[15,"machine",0],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"machine",0],[17,"level-up",1],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"machine",0],[25,"level-up",1],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"spark","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"charge","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"knock-off","learns":[[25,"machin